WEBVTT

00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:55.818
Now that she's arrived in the kind
of magical world she's dreamed of...

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.219
...Arusu couldn't be happier.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:02.259
But it's not exactly the way
she imagined it to be.

00:01:03.097 --> 00:01:06.397
Arusu meets two apprentice witches
who are about her own age...

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.535
...Sheila and Eva.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.562
But as punishment for having
let the fairies escape...

00:01:12.673 --> 00:01:15.802
...the highest-ranking authority
in the Witch Realm...

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:19.607
...the grand master, casts the
Curse of Eternal Youth on them.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:50.535
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:59.502
Magical Brooms

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.539
You...

00:03:04.618 --> 00:03:06.586
Who are you?

00:03:09.556 --> 00:03:10.546
Ta-da!

00:03:12.359 --> 00:03:15.590
I'm the Magician of Happiness,
the Great Arusu!

00:03:16.964 --> 00:03:17.863
Arusu?

00:03:17.965 --> 00:03:21.765
Hey, is everything clear now?
That's how you use magic!

00:03:21.902 --> 00:03:24.064
Magic? That was just a
sleight-of-hand trick!

00:03:24.171 --> 00:03:24.967
That's right! That's right!

00:03:25.072 --> 00:03:27.166
Oops, you mean I'm busted?

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:31.540
This one's just a moron.
She hit her head, see!

00:03:31.645 --> 00:03:32.476
I'm sorry.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:33.456
Here, take that side.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.675
Here, take that side.
Okay.

00:03:34.815 --> 00:03:37.944
We'll do our best to recapture
the fairies. Please excuse us.

00:03:38.986 --> 00:03:41.455
So that young girl is the rebel, I see.

00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:44.490
She did seem somewhat thick, didn't she?

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:47.925
There's no point unless we cut off
such rebels at the root.

00:03:48.028 --> 00:03:50.292
Until we find evidence of
the rebel organization...

00:03:50.364 --> 00:03:52.833
...I want you to keep
an eye on that girl.

00:03:52.933 --> 00:03:54.332
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:57.204 --> 00:03:59.901
Ow... Come on, that hurts!

00:04:00.007 --> 00:04:01.406
What are you doing?

00:04:01.508 --> 00:04:05.638
But if Sheila hadn't covered for you,
they would've found out that you're...

00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:08.841
...a human, and you'd be in
even bigger trouble now.

00:04:09.683 --> 00:04:11.845
Listen, why is it bad news
to be a human?

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:14.315
Well, because humans are...

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.718
Don't say anything
she doesn't need to know!

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:18.917
If they find out we were with her
knowing she was human...

00:04:19.026 --> 00:04:20.994
...we're gonna end up in hot water too.

00:04:21.061 --> 00:04:24.520
| can't let you drag us down
any more than you already have.

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:26.360
| have no desire to rescue you at all.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.865
Now taking off!

00:04:31.805 --> 00:04:34.672
Hey... I'm hungry!

00:04:34.808 --> 00:04:38.039
There's no future for us
unless we catch the fairies.

00:04:38.145 --> 00:04:40.136
No way am I gonna let you...

00:04:40.714 --> 00:04:41.374
Eva?

00:04:41.782 --> 00:04:43.841
We're never gonna make it...

00:04:44.418 --> 00:04:47.683
After all that hard work,
we still couldn't do it, remember?

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:51.224
We couldn't catch a single fairy!

00:04:51.692 --> 00:04:54.684
And now we'll never become
full-fledged witches.

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:56.729
We'll never get married.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.390
We're doomed to be stuck
in childhood forever.

00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:01.558
That's the problem with you!

00:05:02.936 --> 00:05:06.372
Whether it's magic or anything else
in life, as soon as you hit a bump...

00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:08.551
...in the road, you just give up!

00:05:08.575 --> 00:05:09.542
...in the road, you just give up!
Now, now...

00:05:09.643 --> 00:05:12.271
Hey, let's get
some delicious food and...

00:05:12.379 --> 00:05:13.590
Right, Eva?
We'll be arriving at Baba Yaga.

00:05:13.614 --> 00:05:14.706
We'll be arriving at Baba Yaga.

00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:15.976
Hold on a sec.

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:19.147
How come we were the only ones?

00:05:19.219 --> 00:05:19.913
Huh?

00:05:20.754 --> 00:05:24.019
They think you're an apprentice witch,
just like us...

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:26.282
So why not curse you too?

00:05:29.363 --> 00:05:33.630
Hey, I'm hungry, you guys!
Let's go get something to eat!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.791
What's this place famous for?

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:38.462
Come to think of it, I don't know
anything about this world.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.666
Well, the pancakes are really yummy.

00:05:40.741 --> 00:05:41.867
Pancakes?

00:05:41.975 --> 00:05:44.467
You know what,
pancakes cooked up by witches...

00:05:44.578 --> 00:05:46.637
That does sound yummy!

00:05:46.747 --> 00:05:49.011
Hey, what's the difference
between pancakes and hotcakes?

00:05:49.116 --> 00:05:50.126
I'm challenging you to a match.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:50.708
I'm challenging you to a match.
Huh?

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:51.943
A broom race.

00:05:52.052 --> 00:05:54.180
If you lose, you have to stop
following me around everywhere.

00:05:54.254 --> 00:05:56.086
What the heck is she talking about?

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:59.318
She can't take you on.
Sweetheart is human after all.

00:05:59.426 --> 00:06:00.436
She can't possibly beat you...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.518
She can't possibly beat you...
Anyone can use magic...

00:06:01.628 --> 00:06:04.529
...if they believe with all their heart.
She said it herself.

00:06:04.631 --> 00:06:05.041
But...

00:06:05.065 --> 00:06:05.998
But...
Look, you...

00:06:06.166 --> 00:06:07.861
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:11.268
Magic isn't something
you should use for fighting.

00:06:11.805 --> 00:06:15.070
That kind of childish
thinking doesn't fly here.

00:06:15.409 --> 00:06:17.935
And if you don't want to race me,
I'll be happy to ditch you.

00:06:18.011 --> 00:06:20.810
Yeah, yeah, gotcha, gotcha.

00:06:20.914 --> 00:06:23.576
| won't ever get into your
business again, Sheila.

00:06:23.684 --> 00:06:26.085
But you're not getting
any of my chestnuts either.

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:27.345
So there!

00:06:28.021 --> 00:06:29.921
See ya later, bye-bye!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.934
Oh! Sweetheart!

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:33.016
Oh! Sweetheart!
Let her go.

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:34.150
But...

00:06:34.528 --> 00:06:36.656
It's better not to have
anything to do with her.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.960
Atelia senses something about her too.

00:06:39.032 --> 00:06:41.126
We can't get involved or there'll
be trouble for us as well.

00:06:41.201 --> 00:06:42.362
Here.

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:46.165
Hey!

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:51.173
Oh, do what you want.

00:06:52.446 --> 00:06:55.643
But the thing is I have nowhere to go.

00:06:55.749 --> 00:06:58.150
Man, I'm starving.

00:07:01.455 --> 00:07:03.253
Sweetheart!

00:07:08.061 --> 00:07:12.498
| know Sheila said some awful things,
but I'm your fan, sweetheart!

00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:15.803
We've got a lot to
figure out, but first...

00:07:15.902 --> 00:07:18.428
...let's go get some yummy pancakes...

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:22.206
Sweetheart?

00:07:22.743 --> 00:07:24.643
Can't you save him somehow?

00:07:24.711 --> 00:07:26.201
I'll ask Sheila!

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:27.110
Wait.

00:07:28.215 --> 00:07:32.550
Sheila's just gonna hand him over
to those old-lady witches, isn't she?

00:07:32.619 --> 00:07:34.178
Well...

00:07:35.622 --> 00:07:38.523
| guess Sheila and I are gonna
have to duke it out with magic!

00:07:38.692 --> 00:07:42.390
But magic is something
you use to make people happy...

00:07:42.496 --> 00:07:44.988
That's right. If I win, that is!

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.457
Save the mina fairy and let it go?

00:07:48.535 --> 00:07:52.301
And let sweetheart eat pancakes
till she's ready to burst!

00:07:53.273 --> 00:07:54.798
Fine by me.

00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:59.244
Oh wow, that's just like
the textbooks we use!

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:01.280
This will be a piece of cake.

00:08:01.381 --> 00:08:04.248
No human can ever fail
trying to do the right thing!

00:08:04.351 --> 00:08:06.786
Oh wait, I guess
I'm the only human here!

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:10.255
All right, we're going to circle the
lake once. That hill is the finish line.

00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:11.688
On your marks...

00:08:12.459 --> 00:08:13.426
Get set...

00:08:14.961 --> 00:08:15.757
Go!

00:08:19.666 --> 00:08:23.034
Looks like she doesn't even know
how to ride a broom properly...

00:08:23.203 --> 00:08:25.399
Just because she looked it up
in a book of spells...

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:26.529
Book of spells?

00:08:27.107 --> 00:08:28.233
What are you doing?

00:08:28.341 --> 00:08:29.285
Sheila took off already!

00:08:29.309 --> 00:08:29.867
Sheila took off already!
Yeah.

00:08:29.976 --> 00:08:32.035
But if I straddle this thing,
it's gonna hurt, right?

00:08:32.479 --> 00:08:33.913
Hey, I got it!

00:08:34.047 --> 00:08:35.879
All right, let's go!

00:08:45.659 --> 00:08:47.627
Oh, wow! That's amazing!

00:08:47.727 --> 00:08:50.094
Hey, I'm gonna wait for you
at the finish line, okay?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.798
Go after her!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.598
So a human is just a human after all.

00:08:59.706 --> 00:09:01.868
Oh, Sheila!

00:09:06.746 --> 00:09:10.808
They used to call me the Skateboard King
way back when, you know!

00:09:12.052 --> 00:09:13.451
Pardon me!

00:09:16.289 --> 00:09:17.256
Dammit!

00:09:27.067 --> 00:09:28.728
Whoops-a-daisy!

00:09:44.284 --> 00:09:46.343
Oh no! The mina fairy!

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:50.014
What?

00:09:51.024 --> 00:09:52.014
Eva!

00:09:52.459 --> 00:09:53.790
Sweetheart!

00:09:56.263 --> 00:09:57.890
Are you all right?

00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:05.529
I'm so sorry...

00:10:05.639 --> 00:10:07.937
Hey, I told you
it wasn't your fault, Eva.

00:10:08.008 --> 00:10:08.975
It's all right.

00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:09.600
Move.

00:10:21.821 --> 00:10:22.344
Oh...

00:10:22.422 --> 00:10:25.255
Hey, just let him go!
Now that he's well again...

00:10:27.193 --> 00:10:28.337
Thank you, Sheila!

00:10:28.361 --> 00:10:29.795
Thank you, Sheila!
As for you -- you lost!

00:10:29.896 --> 00:10:30.506
Get out of here.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:30.996
Get out of here.
Huh?

00:10:31.731 --> 00:10:33.460
Don't ever hang around us again.

00:10:33.533 --> 00:10:34.193
But...

00:10:34.301 --> 00:10:35.478
A deal is a deal.

00:10:35.502 --> 00:10:36.128
A deal is a deal.
Sheila!

00:10:36.236 --> 00:10:38.728
All right, fine! So long, guys!

00:10:41.074 --> 00:10:43.406
Arusu is all alone, you know!

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.735
She's a human, you know!

00:10:49.683 --> 00:10:52.380
Did you just hear
that unimaginable word?

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:57.548
| think she said...
a p-p-prune...

00:10:58.058 --> 00:10:59.958
She said human.

00:11:00.694 --> 00:11:03.755
Human? Not only that,
but she has a book of spells?

00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:09.458
Atelia, we have brought the
special task force for capturing fairies!

00:11:09.602 --> 00:11:10.728
Brought 'em!

00:11:12.405 --> 00:11:16.035
Just now... I have added
something to your workload.

00:11:17.677 --> 00:11:21.045
You are to take away
that girl's book of spells.

00:11:21.481 --> 00:11:23.540
No matter what it takes!

00:11:33.059 --> 00:11:36.051
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.567 --> 00:11:45.004
The Ecoo Fairy

00:11:47.207 --> 00:11:49.073
Do you believe in magic?

00:11:49.142 --> 00:11:51.975
Yes! I'm gonna get on a broom
and fly in the sky.

00:11:52.078 --> 00:11:53.409
Where do you want to go?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.575
Um... um... beyond the sky!

00:11:57.017 --> 00:12:00.009
Well then, you'd better keep
that belief in a safe place.

00:12:00.086 --> 00:12:01.053
Belief?

00:12:01.321 --> 00:12:04.222
That's right. A heart that believes.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:06.653
As long as you believe
with all your heart...

00:12:06.726 --> 00:12:09.195
...anyone can use magic, you know.

00:12:15.702 --> 00:12:19.935
Hey, Yoko! The milk in the fridge
is past its expiration date!

00:12:22.242 --> 00:12:25.143
So it was just a dream.

00:12:26.613 --> 00:12:28.945
But the thing is,
it's this world that...

00:12:29.049 --> 00:12:31.711
...looks more like a dream,
no matter what!

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:35.119
A heart that believes, huh?

00:12:35.221 --> 00:12:37.622
Isn't there some kind of magic
that will send me home?

00:12:37.757 --> 00:12:40.522
Oh, well, I guess that
would be too convenient!

00:12:42.729 --> 00:12:43.628
Huh?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.844
Who the heck are you?

00:12:48.868 --> 00:12:49.645
Who the heck are you?
| might ask the same of you!

00:12:49.669 --> 00:12:50.693
| might ask the same of you!

00:12:52.639 --> 00:12:56.371
Hey, what do you know! You're
the little girl from the other day!

00:12:57.043 --> 00:12:58.374
You know who I am?

00:12:58.578 --> 00:13:02.515
Sure, you're the little girl who blasted off
on that broom and set us all free!

00:13:02.582 --> 00:13:06.109
For real? Am I that famous?
Hey, this is embarrassing.

00:13:06.186 --> 00:13:09.053
But if you really want to thank me,
you could treat me to breakfast!

00:13:09.122 --> 00:13:10.783
I'm not that thankful, sorry!

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:19.096
The ecoo fairies are a type of fairy
that will grant a child just one wish.

00:13:21.701 --> 00:13:25.365
They mainly inhabit sandy beaches
and give off a unique scent.

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:26.799
They smell.

00:13:28.341 --> 00:13:29.365
You're late!

00:13:29.509 --> 00:13:32.444
Well, I couldn't sleep
at all last night.

00:13:32.579 --> 00:13:35.207
After breakfast, we're going
to capture some fairies.

00:13:35.315 --> 00:13:37.784
| wonder where sweetheart
spent the night?

00:13:37.884 --> 00:13:39.648
| wonder if she had anything to eat?

00:13:39.719 --> 00:13:41.744
You don't care if you never grow up?

00:13:42.889 --> 00:13:45.984
Stop worrying about other people.
You should worry about yourself first!

00:13:46.092 --> 00:13:48.959
But there's no way we're ever gonna
recapture all of the fairies...

00:13:49.028 --> 00:13:50.018
...that escaped!

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:52.565
So did you manage to
get that book of spells?

00:13:52.632 --> 00:13:54.157
We're still working on that.

00:13:54.267 --> 00:13:57.202
But that special task force
is something else!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.967
| hear they've been delivering
fairy after fairy all morning!

00:14:00.073 --> 00:14:03.236
They sure are living up to their
reputations as the best and brightest...

00:14:03.343 --> 00:14:05.539
...that you handpicked yourself!

00:14:16.823 --> 00:14:19.588
All we need are the
tails and nails and such...

00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:22.184
Whatever we can use
for magic, am I wrong?

00:14:22.295 --> 00:14:23.990
Who gives a damn about the rest...

00:14:24.063 --> 00:14:27.795
You're right... I think we deserve
at least a little entertainment.

00:14:27.901 --> 00:14:31.030
You'd better watch your mouth!

00:14:31.137 --> 00:14:34.539
That's right! If Atelia hadn't
put in a good word for you...

00:14:34.641 --> 00:14:37.804
...you would've all been
sent to the Human Realm!

00:14:39.445 --> 00:14:42.813
There's nothing to worry about.
We've destroyed nothing.

00:14:42.949 --> 00:14:45.543
There'd be no point in killing them!

00:14:45.652 --> 00:14:49.213
Atelia... this whole bunch
should be fired right now!

00:14:49.289 --> 00:14:49.949
Fired!

00:14:50.056 --> 00:14:51.649
Do whatever you want.

00:14:51.724 --> 00:14:55.592
In the same manner you've
always conducted your business.

00:14:55.695 --> 00:14:58.426
Just remember that your
top priority is to steal the...

00:14:58.498 --> 00:14:59.742
...the book of spells from that girl.

00:14:59.766 --> 00:15:01.063
...the book of spells from that girl.
We know! We know!

00:15:01.167 --> 00:15:04.899
And under no circumstances
are you to harm that girl in any way.

00:15:04.971 --> 00:15:06.598
Oh, save your breath!

00:15:07.774 --> 00:15:10.266
What a bunch of barbaric slimeballs!

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:15.777
Hmm... What should I wish for?

00:15:16.816 --> 00:15:19.842
Hey, little girl, hurry up
and make up your mind!

00:15:19.919 --> 00:15:22.388
Look, you said you were hungry
a little while ago.

00:15:22.455 --> 00:15:24.389
So why don't you wish for food?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.982
Hey, hang on a second! I'm thinking!

00:15:27.193 --> 00:15:29.525
Should I go for that one?

00:15:29.662 --> 00:15:32.393
Enough chestnuts to fill me up
to the brim! No, wait.

00:15:32.498 --> 00:15:34.330
I'm only getting one wish after all...

00:15:34.434 --> 00:15:36.630
I might as well ask for
something really awesome.

00:15:36.736 --> 00:15:39.569
I know! Fill me up
with gigantic chestnuts?

00:15:39.639 --> 00:15:41.698
Is that all I can think of? Chestnuts?

00:15:41.808 --> 00:15:45.301
What are you hemming and
hawing about? Hurry up!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.549
| want to go back to
my own world, I guess.

00:15:49.649 --> 00:15:51.674
Your own world? What do you mean?

00:15:51.784 --> 00:15:53.752
The Human Realm. I'm a human, see.

00:15:53.853 --> 00:15:56.845
Well, I won't ask for unnecessary
details, but that's final, right?

00:15:56.956 --> 00:15:59.391
Your wish is to go back
to the Human Realm, right?

00:15:59.492 --> 00:16:00.653
Oh, but wait a sec...

00:16:00.727 --> 00:16:03.890
After coming all this way, it kinda
seems like a waste to just leave...

00:16:04.564 --> 00:16:05.531
I know!

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:08.267
Now what?

00:16:08.368 --> 00:16:09.358
Listen...

00:16:10.637 --> 00:16:13.402
Hey, Sheila, are ecoo fairies scary?

00:16:13.506 --> 00:16:15.531
Powerful? Mean?

00:16:16.042 --> 00:16:21.537
Listen, when that ecoo fairy appears,
just make him grant you a wish.

00:16:21.781 --> 00:16:22.543
Why?

00:16:22.749 --> 00:16:25.650
Have him break the
Curse of Eternal Youth.

00:16:25.752 --> 00:16:27.880
I'll recapture the fairies
that got away.

00:16:30.957 --> 00:16:32.186
Is that the ecoo fairy?

00:16:32.292 --> 00:16:35.557
| don't know,
but there are lots of them!

00:16:36.562 --> 00:16:38.690
It looks like they're having a party.

00:16:38.965 --> 00:16:40.057
Let's get closer.

00:16:56.382 --> 00:16:57.315
Sheila!

00:16:58.885 --> 00:17:01.980
You came to try to capture
us again, didn't you?

00:17:15.902 --> 00:17:19.031
Get out of here now or
I'll exterminate this witch!

00:17:19.539 --> 00:17:24.170
Sorry to disappoint you,
but that kid isn't one of us.

00:17:25.345 --> 00:17:26.176
What?

00:17:26.512 --> 00:17:30.210
We're here to capture fairies.
That's all.

00:17:30.983 --> 00:17:34.578
Go ahead and take out that fairy...
along with the apprentice witch!

00:17:45.598 --> 00:17:50.195
Hey, Sheila!
Feel like treating me to dinner?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.193
Huh?

00:17:51.571 --> 00:17:53.938
Sorry, Mr. Ecoo, I'm changing my wish.

00:17:54.006 --> 00:17:56.941
What?
You're changing it again, little girl?

00:17:57.877 --> 00:17:59.470
Sorry, Eva!

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:00.205
Huh?

00:18:00.613 --> 00:18:02.547
Save Sheila.

00:18:02.882 --> 00:18:04.407
Come on, hurry!

00:18:04.484 --> 00:18:05.883
All righty!

00:18:07.453 --> 00:18:10.514
Oh my... I see an ecoo fairy too.

00:18:10.757 --> 00:18:16.218
Hey, isn't that the human girl
that Atelia mentioned?

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:56.228
Sheila, I bet you want to
treat me to dinner now, huh?

00:18:59.906 --> 00:19:02.273
Wow! Thanks for the food!

00:19:02.809 --> 00:19:05.278
It tastes really good if
you put some of this on.

00:19:05.511 --> 00:19:08.276
Eva, this isn't paint, is it?

00:19:08.448 --> 00:19:09.882
What's that?

00:19:11.851 --> 00:19:13.615
Why did you save me?

00:19:13.686 --> 00:19:15.711
Well, shucks, I was hungry.

00:19:15.822 --> 00:19:18.587
I'd hardly eaten anything
since I got here, after all.

00:19:18.691 --> 00:19:21.422
You were really trying
to break the Curse of...

00:19:21.527 --> 00:19:24.019
...Eternal Youth
they put on us, weren't you?

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:27.029
You could tell, huh? Sorry about that!

00:19:27.266 --> 00:19:28.911
Why didn't you use it for yourself?

00:19:28.935 --> 00:19:30.198
Why didn't you use it for yourself?
Just listen to you!

00:19:30.269 --> 00:19:34.763
You were hoping the ecoo fairy would
break the curse on Eva yourself!

00:19:34.907 --> 00:19:37.376
Why didn't you tell him you wanted
go back to the Human Realm?

00:19:37.477 --> 00:19:39.605
I've told you a hundred times...

00:19:39.712 --> 00:19:42.909
...as long as I have a heart
that believes and this book...

00:19:43.149 --> 00:19:43.775
Huh?

00:19:47.487 --> 00:19:48.921
What's wrong?

00:19:49.255 --> 00:19:51.952
The book of spells...
the book is gone...

00:19:52.959 --> 00:19:53.551
Don't tell me...

00:19:55.828 --> 00:19:56.795
Here it is...

00:19:56.929 --> 00:20:00.194
However, the child
whose wish is granted...

00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:03.199
...shall lose one thing dear to her...

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:25.414
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.658 --> 00:20:33.658
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.834 --> 00:20:42.834
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.076 --> 00:20:49.640
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.749 --> 00:20:53.982
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.754 --> 00:20:58.987
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.091 --> 00:21:03.653
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.863 --> 00:21:09.029
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.135 --> 00:21:12.196
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.673 --> 00:21:18.304
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.411 --> 00:21:20.903
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.013 --> 00:21:29.013
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.189 --> 00:21:35.889
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.995 --> 00:21:40.057
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
